{
  "description": "Literal protocol 0.3 messages: the scene document transport between the editor and @ignifx/editor-host. Authored here as the specification for the host's implementation (engine task E16), which should replay these messages in its own tests; docs/protocol.md, \"0.3: scene documents\", explains each one. The applyOps message carries one of each of the thirteen scene ops, in an order that applies cleanly to the openScene file. Test: wire-0.3.test.ts.",
